  "html": "<h1>Embed a Video</h1>\n<div id=\"preamble\">\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>On this page, you&#8217;ll learn:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ulist checklist\">\n<ul class=\"checklist\">\n<li>\n<p>&#10003; How to embed a YouTube or Vimeo video in a page.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"add-a-youtube-or-vimeo-video\">Add a YouTube or Vimeo video</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>To embed a video hosted on YouTube or Vimeo, put the video&#8217;s ID in the macro target and the name of the hosting service (<code>youtube</code>, <code>vimeo</code>) between the brackets.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"title\">Example 1. Embedded YouTube video syntax</div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-asciidoc\" data-lang=\"asciidoc\">video::rPQoq7ThGAU[youtube]</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"admonitionblock tip\">\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<div class=\"title\">Tip</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nInsert animated GIFs with the <a href=\"page:images.html\">image macro</a>.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ulist\">\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>AsciiDoc and Asciidoctor resources</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/macros/audio-and-video/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Video macro</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/macros/audio-and-video/#audio-and-video-attributes-and-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Video macro options and attributes</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
}
